# D3 stuck low: named in ROM4 (ROM3 has no data under EmuMD).
@fault 1 3 0
say "^Device:  test firmware, header unreadable" 100
say "^Press a key" 100
key x
key l
say "^ROM4:" 12000
say "^FAIL  Data line D3 is stuck low" 100
say "^  GPIO 9, \d+ errors in \d+ reads" 100
say "^Check D3's level shifter" 100
log "Line test verdict 1: class 2," 500
